# Root build context (apps/web/Dockerfile builds from here). Keep host-built
# artifacts out of the image — node_modules especially, since native deps
# (sharp) built on the host for macOS/darwin will not run in the Linux image;
# `pnpm install` inside the Dockerfile rebuilds them correctly instead.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
.git
